  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1755838695_9402163_701a0ff39765c73e9f7abdd1d2cd9912.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:</strong><br>Eroomsplus Japan is Japan base company owner of <em><strong>Harajuku Candy.<br></strong></em><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Menlo-Regular; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none; float: none; display: inline;\"><strong>Harajuku candy </strong>brand is a vibrant and innovative confectionery company inspired by the eccentric and colorful Harajuku fashion and culture in Tokyo, Japan. Our brand brings together the distinctiveness of Harajuku with the sweet and delightful world of candies, creating unique and exciting treats.</span><br style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Menlo-Regular; font-size: 11px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\"><br style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Menlo-Regular; font-size: 11px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\"><br style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Menlo-Regular; font-size: 11px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\"><strong>&bull; Product description:</strong><br>We specialise local and internatoional confectionaries, Toys and unique Harajuku Styles accessories.<br><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Menlo-Regular; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none; float: none; display: inline;\">Our candies are carefully crafted with high-quality ingredients and innovative flavor combinations to provide an immersive and enjoyable experience for our customers. From traditional favorites like gummy bears and lollipops with a Harajuku twist to original creations such as matcha-flavored cotton candy and sushi-shaped sour candies, we strive to push the boundaries of traditional candy-making.</span><br><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):<br>In addition to our creative flavors, our packaging reflects the fun and vibrant Harajuku spirit. Bold, eye-catching colors, cute characters, and whimsical designs grace each pack, making our products stand out on the shelves and captivating candy lovers of all ages.<br><br>We believe in creating moments of joy and delight with our candies, whether it's through a small treat for yourself, a gift to a loved one, or a cheerful addition to a special event. Harajuku candy brand is here to bring you a taste of the unique and enchanting Harajuku culture with every bite. So join us on this sweet journey and indulge in the playful goodness of Harajuku candies.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms: Negotiable.&nbsp;<br><br>&bull; Other information: Feel free to contact us</p>\r\n</div>",
